# Validation, i18n & Quality

## Validation (handler)

1. Parse failure → `errors.From("BAD_REQUEST")`
2. `validator.Validate(payload)` → `VALIDATION_FAILED.WithDetail(firstErrorOnly)`

Payload tags live in `internal/services/{domain}/payload.go`:

```go
Name string `json:"name" validate:"required"`
```

Custom validators: `pkg/utils/validator/custom_validator.go`

## i18n

- `cmd/apiserver/app/locale/id.json`, `en-US.json`
- Validation message keys: **`ERR_{field}`**

## Commands (Makefile)

```bash
make lint   # go vet ./...
make test   # go test -v -race ./...
make run    # go run ./cmd/apiserver server
make tidy
```

Run `make lint` before finishing.

## Goroutines

No raw `go func()` without panic recovery.
